{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Flip Ability</strong>: Your chessmen have a flip ability.  Use this to hide or flip a chessman at a specific moment to release the &quot;flip skill&quot; to shock your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Diverse Chessmen</strong>: Chessmen have unique traits: &quot;Swordsman&quot; who causes powerful attacks, &quot;Observer&quot; who obtains information from the opponent, and &quot;Lightning Man&quot; who creates large-scale control effects.  Utilize the mutual cooperation among chessmen to launch a powerful offensive against the opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Rich card selection</strong>: Add magic cards of three colors to your deck: red cards for powerful damage, blue cards for controlling skills, and green cards for protection and resource acquisition.  Explore the multiple possibilities of the combination of cards and chessmen!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2962030?t=1755762064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2962030?t=1755762064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/b13252b53c1721b94115102381542c5ea36457c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755762064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/b13252b53c1721b94115102381542c5ea36457c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755762064","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Flip Ability</strong>: Your chessmen have a flip ability.  Use this to hide or flip a chessman at a specific moment to release the &quot;flip skill&quot; to shock your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Diverse Chessmen</strong>: Chessmen have unique traits: &quot;Swordsman&quot; who causes powerful attacks, &quot;Observer&quot; who obtains information from the opponent, and &quot;Lightning Man&quot; who creates large-scale control effects.  Utilize the mutual cooperation among chessmen to launch a powerful offensive against the opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Rich card selection</strong>: Add magic cards of three colors to your deck: red cards for powerful damage, blue cards for controlling skills, and green cards for protection and resource acquisition.  Explore the multiple possibilities of the combination of cards and chessmen!</p>","developers":["ZJCTY"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962030/3bd0494758502991107c030d1eb98ca1c584a36e/header.jpg?t=1755762064","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2962030/1495526363/8b2d7e1a852b61691a30c105474663d141b93d95/1755670556/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755762063","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2962030/1495526363/8b2d7e1a852b61691a30c105474663d141b93d95/1755670556/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755762063","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2962030/1495526363/8b2d7e1a852b61691a30c105474663d141b93d95/1755670556/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755762063","id":257025466,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257025466/movie480.mp4?t=1755762063","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257025466/movie_max.mp4?t=1755762063"},"name":"\u7ffb\u9762\u68cb\u5175 \u6e38\u620f\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257025466/82cf71d36dcd99ba963fcef35082568021dd608e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755762063","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstati